r%20languages%20%28JS%2FWASM%2C%20Python%2C%20C%23%2C%20Go%2C%20Java%29%20%2A%2Amay%2A%2A%20follow%2C%20matching%20the%20multi-language%20parity%20tradition%20of%20links-notation%20%2890%2B%20identical%20cross-language%20tests%29%20and%20lino-objects-codec.%0A%0A%23%23%206.%20Test%20strategy%20%E2%80%94%20replicate%20the%20whole%20ecosystem%27s%20feature%20sets%0A%0AWe%20deliberately%20treat%20the%20discussed%20projects%20as%20%2A%2Aexample%20suites%20to%20satisfy%2A%2A.%20We%20copy%2Fadapt%20their%20test%20cases%20so%20our%20system%20provably%20supports%20them%20all%3A%0A%0A-%20%5B%20%5D%20%2A%2Alinks-notation%2A%2A%3A%20the%20doublet%2Ftriplet%2FN-tuple%2Findented%20parsing%20tests%20%E2%80%94%20our%20network%20must%20parse%20and%20reproduce%20all%20LiNo%20forms%2C%20including%20self-referential%20links%20%28points%29.%0A-%20%5B%20%5D%20%2A%2Alink-cli%2A%2A%3A%20the%20substitution%20test%20cases%20%28create%20%60%28%29%20%28%281%201%29%29%60%2C%20update%20%60%28%281%3A%201%201%29%29%20%28%281%3A%201%202%29%29%60%2C%20delete%20%60%28%281%202%29%29%20%28%29%60%2C%20swap%20%60%28%28%28%24index%3A%20%24source%20%24target%29%29%20%28%28%24index%3A%20%24target%20%24source%29%29%29%60%29%20%E2%80%94%20our%20transform%20layer%20must%20reproduce%20them%20exactly%2C%20including%20named%20references%2C%20triggers%2C%20structure%20formatting%2C%20dedup.%0A-%20%5B%20%5D%20%2A%2Alino-objects-codec%2A%2A%3A%20round-trip%20tests%20%60decode%28encode%28x%29%29%20%3D%3D%20x%60%2C%20circular%2Fshared-reference%20preservation.%0A-%20%5B%20%5D%20%2A%2Arelative-meta-logic%2A%2A%3A%20dependent-type%2C%20many-valued%2C%20and%20paradox%20cases%3B%20JS%E2%86%94Rust%20parity-corpus%20pattern.%0A-%20%5B%20%5D%20%2A%2Aformal-ai%2A%2A%3A%20replay%20its%20%2A%2A706-case%20corpus%2A%2A%20as%20a%20parity%20%2F%20no-regression%20gate.%0A-%20%5B%20%5D%20%2A%2Ameta-expression%2A%2A%3A%20the%20formalize%20%E2%86%92%20semantic-meta-language%20%E2%86%92%20naturalize%20round-trip%20cases%20%28e.g.%20%22Hawaii%20is%20a%20state.%22%20%E2%86%92%20%60Q782%60%20%E2%86%92%20%22%D0%93%D0%B0%D0%B2%D0%B0%D0%B9%D0%B8%20%D1%8D%D1%82%D0%BE%20%D1%88%D1%82%D0%B0%D1%82.%22%29%2C%20CST-with-spans%20cases%2C%20%221%20%2B%201%20%3D%202%22%20deterministic%20case%2C%20%22this%20statement%20is%20false%22%20self-reference%20case.%0A-%20%5B%20%5D%20%2A%2Atree-sitter%2A%2A%3A%20representative%20concrete-syntax-tree%2C%20language-injection%20%28mixed%20markdown%2Bcode%29%2C%20query-matching%2C%20and%20error-recovery%20cases%20%E2%80%94%20to%20prove%20feature%20parity%20on%20the%20metadata%20model%20while%20diverging%20to%20a%20unified%20links%20network%20%28node%2Fedge%20collapsed%20into%20links%29.%0A%0A%23%23%207.%20Open%20questions%20%2F%20decisions%20to%20make%0A%0A1.%20Trivia%20attachment%20policy%3A%20containment-link-attached%20%28Rowan-style%29%20vs%20token-link-attached%20%28Roslyn-style%29%20%E2%80%94%20support%20both%20as%20configurable%3F%20%28Default%3F%29%0A2.%20Region%20auto-detection%3A%20how%20far%20to%20push%20content-based%20sniffing%20vs%20name%2Ffence-driven%3B%20confidence%20model%20%28lean%20on%20meta-expression%27s%20bounded-confidence%20approach%29.%0A3.%20Exact%20contract%20surface%20for%20%60%28de%29formalization%60%20configuration%20so%20formal-ai%20and%20meta-expression%20can%20drive%20it%20without%20leaking%20their%20internals.%0A4.%20Snapshot%20model%3A%20copy-on-write%20persistent%20structure%20vs%20explicit%20version%20links%20in%20the%20store%20%28link-cli%20already%20has%20names%2Ftriggers%20files%20%E2%80%94%20reuse%20or%20extend%3F%29.%0A5.%20How%20the%20%22common%20roots%20of%20common%20ontologies%22%20are%20seeded%20and%20how%20language%20vocabularies%20declare%20derivation%20from%20them.%0A6.%20Query%20language%20surface%3A%20adopt%20tree-sitter%20S-expression%20query%20syntax%20over%20links%2C%20or%20a%20LiNo-native%20pattern%20syntax%2C%20or%20both%3F%0A%0A---%0A%0A%2AThis%20issue%20is%20the%20founding%20vision%20%2B%20scope.%20Subsequent%20issues%20should%20break%20out%3A%20%28a%29%20the%20Rust%20core%20data%20model%20%2B%20LiNo%20storage%2C%20%28b%29%20the%20parser%2Fregion-detection%20layer%2C%20%28c%29%20the%20substitution%2Ftransform%20engine%20reusing%20link-cli%27s%20single%20operation%2C%20%28d%29%20the%20common-concept%20ontology%20%2B%20self-description%2C%20%28e%29%20the%20reconstruction%2Fcross-language%20layer%2C%20%28f%29%20the%20per-project%20parity%20test%20corpora.%2A) (lang: meta-language%20structured%20data)))
